# Drives the cmsis-dsp LLVM IR -> SCF MLIR raise pipeline from lit.
# The runner script lives in test/cmsis-dsp/; this lit case is the
# single integration point so the raise pipeline runs alongside the
# rest of the regression suite. We pin LOOM_CC, LOOM_RAISE, and
# LOOM_RAISE_OPT explicitly because lit may run with a clean PATH.
# The bash -c wrapper turns on pipefail so a runner exit-nonzero
# before the summary line still propagates failure through the
# FileCheck pipe.
#
# The all-pass summary is gating; the SCF-coverage footer is checked
# loosely (count varies as loom-raise improves) but pinned to the
# current expected denominator so a regression that drops the
# structured-control recovery rate trips the test.
#
# RUN: bash -c 'set -o pipefail; env LOOM_CC=%loom-cc LOOM_RAISE=%loom-raise LOOM_RAISE_OPT=%loom-raise-opt bash %S/../cmsis-dsp/run_cmsis_dsp_raise.sh' | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: ==== cmsis-dsp raise smoke summary ====
# CHECK: all 16 cmsis-dsp source(s) passed loom-raise
# CHECK: {{[0-9]+}} of 16 cmsis-dsp source(s) contain SCF ops
